WEBVTT

00:00:05.124 --> 00:00:08.654
Choose Sponsors in the side menu.

00:00:08.904 --> 00:00:11.556
Click Add sponsor.

00:00:11.806 --> 00:00:16.674
Type "Demo Radio Two (test)"
in the Sponsor name box.

00:00:16.925 --> 00:00:21.192
Type "Demo Contact" in
the Contact name box.

00:00:21.442 --> 00:00:26.313
Type "radio2@example.com"
in the Contact email box.

00:00:26.563 --> 00:00:31.767
Type "Test sponsor for the
help videos." in the Notes box.

00:00:32.017 --> 00:00:35.239
Click Save sponsor.

00:00:35.489 --> 00:00:40.629
Check that Demo Radio Two
(test) shows as the page title.

00:00:40.879 --> 00:00:44.394
Click Add creative.

00:00:44.644 --> 00:00:48.776
Check that Headline shows in the new form.

00:00:49.026 --> 00:00:54.029
Type "Demo welcome message
(test)" in the Headline box.

00:00:54.279 --> 00:00:59.483
Type "Welcome to our test
sponsor." in the Short text box.

00:00:59.733 --> 00:01:05.288
Type "https://example.com/demo"
in the Link box.

00:01:05.538 --> 00:01:09.605
Choose a file for the Square picture box.

00:01:09.855 --> 00:01:15.528
Type "Welcome picture, test only"
in the Picture description box.

00:01:15.778 --> 00:01:20.195
Click Save creative.

00:01:20.445 --> 00:01:26.119
Check that Demo welcome message
(test) shows in the sponsor page.
